# Imported model data and machine-specific Power BI state.
**/.pbi/cache.abf
**/.pbi/localSettings.json
**/.pbi/unappliedChanges.json
**/.pbi/daxQueries.json
**/.pbi/tmdlscripts.json

# Data-containing report packages and backups are transferred separately.
*.pbix
*.abf
backups/
private/
**/report_backup_*/
**/report_before_*/

# Private presentation notes must never be committed.
scripts.md
**/scripts.md

# Credentials and local environment configuration.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
credentials.json
secrets.json

# Operating-system and temporary files.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
*.tmp
*.bak
*.log
~$*
